1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:11,000
每一种观看，都在寻找一种安放。
Every way of seeing searches for a place to belong.

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:25,000
山水可以是内心的居所。
A landscape can become an inward dwelling.

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:36,000
王蒙让密集的笔触，围住一处幽静。
Wang Meng surrounds a quiet retreat with restless brushwork.

4
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:47,000
安宁不是空无，而是纷扰中的一小块空间。
Calm is a small space held inside turbulence.

5
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:01,000
世界似乎可以被测量。
The world appears measurable.

6
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:13,000
但丢勒的《忧郁 I》，没有给出单一答案。
Yet Dürer’s Melencolia I offers no single answer.

7
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:23,000
工具越精密，人的迟疑越清晰。
The sharper our tools, the clearer our uncertainty.

8
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:38,000
在北斋的浪中，山峰缩成远处的一点。
In Hokusai’s wave, the mountain contracts into the distance.

9
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
木版让瞬间可以重复，蓝色跨过海洋。
Woodblocks repeat an instant; blue travels across oceans.

10
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:59,000
我们既渴望力量，也知道自己脆弱。
We long for power, knowing how fragile we are.

11
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:14,000
修拉把夜晚，分解为彼此相邻的色点。
Seurat breaks the night into neighboring touches of color.

12
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:26,000
人群聚集在灯下。目光，也成为一种交易。
A crowd gathers in artificial light. Attention becomes an exchange.

13
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:35,000
越是明亮，越能感到人与人之间的距离。
The brighter the spectacle, the more palpable the distance.

14
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
二十世纪的抽象，试着重新安排关系。
Twentieth-century abstraction tries to rearrange relationships.

15
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:01,000
在蒙德里安那里，平衡是一种理想。
For Mondrian, equilibrium is an ideal.

16
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:15,000
今天，每一种目光都可能被计算。
Today, every glance can become a measurement.

17
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:25,000
被看见，不等于被理解。
To be seen is not necessarily to be understood.

18
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:36,000
也许美，是把注意力重新交还给自己。
Perhaps beauty is the return of our attention to ourselves.
